        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1158 12 Inch Offset Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 12\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial offset door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy to use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1158_size.gif?v=1704354682\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1158 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/8-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1156\"><b>8\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/9-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1160\"><b>9\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/10-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1157\"><b>10\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/18-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1159\"><b>18\" Offset Door Pull</b></a> and other style <a href=\"/collections/don-jo-door-pulls\"><b>Don-Jo Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 3 different materials in 6 finish choices.<br>\r\n**Solid Aluminum: Clear, Dark Bronze, or Black Anodized finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1158 12\" Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Point: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1158.pdf?v=1704262261\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1158 Offset Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Offset Door Pull, Don-Jo 1158",
                "description": "Don-Jo 1158 12 inch offset door handle. Standard 1 inch diameter x 12 inch center to center (CTC) commercial offset door pulls. Made of solid bar stock, available in your choice of 5 different finish colors.",
